# nocterm provenance

The garage fork of nocterm (upstream 0.9.0 + garage patches 1-9) lives at:

  Fork:   https://github.com/adar2378/nocterm  (branch: garage)
  Pinned: 2ba41b4fa75dd52840d79ab7fa2707d3ef1d3f11
          (v0.9.0 tag c1b21f4 + one commit "garage patches 1-9 over 0.9.0")

tui/pubspec.yaml consumes it as a git dependency pinned to that SHA.

The patch registry — every patch's rationale, `PATCHED (garage ...)`
markers, and regression-test pointers — lives in GARAGE_PATCHES.md at the
fork's root. Any new patch MUST be added there, on the fork, and the pinned
SHA here and in tui/pubspec.yaml bumped.

Local dev against a checkout of the fork uses pubspec_overrides.yaml
(gitignored; see tui/pubspec_overrides.yaml.example).
